# Inverted chat at the bottom: bursts of appends, then sending from the composer.
route Chat
latency 250,700
wait 3
mark append-1
press 333 80
wait 2.5
mark append-2
press 333 80
wait 2.5
mark send-short
ad press 180 822
wait 1
ad type hello
wait 0.5
ad press 377 511
wait 2.5
mark append-keyboard-open
press 333 80
wait 2.5
mark send-long
ad type aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
wait 1
ad press 377 511
wait 2.5
mark append-after-long
press 333 80
wait 2.5
